msgid "Using OpenAPI and Swagger UI"
msgstr "使用OpenAPI和Swagger UI"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can expose its API description through an OpenAPI specification and\n"
"how you can test it via a user-friendly UI named Swagger UI."
msgstr "本指南介绍了如何让您的 Quarkus 应用程序通过 OpenAPI 规范公开其 API 描述，以及如何通过一个名为 Swagger UI 的用户友好型界面对其进行测试。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

